i","Agencies and consultancies that bill a small number of clients and will not raise equity",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Agencies and consultancies that bill a small number of clients and will not raise equity"}]]}],["$","li","Family businesses wanting liability capped without the audit load of a company",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Family businesses wanting liability capped without the audit load of a company"}]]}],["$","li","Businesses that need an MCA-registered entity for a customer or a lender, and nothing more",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Businesses that need an MCA-registered entity for a customer or a lender, and no