32:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"Local considerations"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"What is worth checking in Ahmedabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"These are the points that actually differ by market, rather than the general features of the structure."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","The LLP Agreement is the whole thing",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"The LLP Agreement is the whole thing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"An LLP's internal rules come almost entirely from its agreement, not from statute. For an Ahmedabad trading firm converting from a partnership, that is where the existing understanding about capital, profit shares, drawings and who can commit the business gets written down properly, often for the first time. It must be filed in Form 3 within thirty days of incorporation."}]]}],["$","li","Converting an existing firm is not a fresh start",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Converting an existing firm is not a fresh start"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"If you are moving an existing Ahmedabad partnership firm into an LLP, the business does not simply carry on unchanged on paper. The LLP gets a new PAN, bank mandates have to be redone, and GST registration, licences and ongoing contracts need to be moved across. It is worth doing, but it is a project, not a form."}]]}],["$","li","Lower compliance, not no compliance",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Lower compliance, not no compliance"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"An LLP must file Form 11 by 30 May and Form 8 by 30 October every year, including in a year with no activity at all. Late filing carries a per-day penalty that keeps accruing until you file, and dormant Ahmedabad LLPs that were set up and forgotten are a common and expensive problem."}]]}],["$","li","No equity, so no investors",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"No equity, so no investors"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"An LLP cannot issue equity shares. If there is any real prospect of raising an angel or venture round, which in Ahmedabad there often is, the LLP will have to be converted to a company first, and that conversion costs more than incorporating correctly at the start. This is the one question worth settling honestly before you choose."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
